  data: {
    LLM: "Keep track of the 'Five'. Since the 5 of Trumps is the 'King' of the game, if you have it, you can control any lead.\n\nThe Ace of Hearts strategy: Because the Ace of Hearts is always a trump, use it as a 'surprise' card when an opponent leads a suit you are void in.\n\nBidding Accuracy: In Fifty-Five, overbidding is fatal. Only bid 25 or 30 if you have at least two of the top three trumps (5, Jack, or Ace of Hearts).",
